# FieldAccess on tuples: only the underscore alias `._0`/`._1`/… is legal
# (language-reference §4.2 / §7.8); bare `.0` is TupleFieldAccess. Any other
# named field on a tuple must REJECT at check time with E_NoFieldFound.
# Pins the residual of the T2b soundness fix (Track C).
void main():
    auto t = (1, 2)
    print(t.foo)
